Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么了  阁楼的窗户怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What? What happened to the window in the attic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不敢相信他们要把它卖掉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe Mom and Dad are selling the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}却没有告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe they didn't even tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}阁楼的窗户到底是怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe I still don't know what happened to the window in the attic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊  我会买张新椅子赔你  好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, come on. Joey, I'll buy you a new one, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们马上到店里去  帮你买一张新椅子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We'll go down to the store right now and we'll get you a new chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她还尸骨未寒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's not even cold yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}萝希塔难道不希望  你继续过你的日子吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But don't you think Rosita would've wanted you to move on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是说她永远  把你的幸福放在第一位{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, you know, she did always put your comfort first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.99,0:02:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不敢相信  我们得跟小时候的家说再见了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I can't believe we have to say goodbye to the house we grew up in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊  有个陌生人  就要搬进我的房间里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Man, some stranger's gonna be living in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}15年来  他们把你房间  弄得跟神宠差不多{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, after 15 years of Morn and Dad keeping it as a shrine to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在一切都该落幕了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...it's time the velvet ropes came down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们也保留你房间有一阵子了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They kept your room a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拜托  我搬出来20分钟后  爸就把我的房间变成健身房了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, please. Dad turned my room into a gym 20 minutes after I moved out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得说  一张日光浴椅  跟一堆维多利亚秘密的目录{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I gotta say, a tanning bed and a stack of Victoria's Secret catalogs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那不是健身房{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Not a gym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样  你知道他们爱你  就跟他们爱你一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on. You know they love you. As much as they love you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我没出生前  他们以为她不会生  那不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was their first born. They thought she was barren. It's not my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我讨厌今年{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ugh. I hate this year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}今年有什么不对的了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's wrong with this year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在已经是二月  我只接到两个按摩客人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's already February and I've only given two massages...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而且他们给小费都给得很吝啬{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and they were both the worst tippers in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你是指我跟罗斯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That was me and Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}喔  没错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果你需要钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, y'know if you want to pick up some extra cash...{\r}
